      "message": "You needed to add compile_dex to them because they are shared and at the moment shared libraries don\u0027t automatically pass compile_dex:true to their stub libraries. Stub libraries need to provide dex files for hidden API processing as it consumes dex files.\n\nApart from the compile_dex:true effect the behavior of the bootclasspath_fragment is not affected by whether a library is shared or not so a test for shared would be unnecessary duplication.\n\nI will try and see whether I can always set compile_dex: true on stub libraries in separate change at which point I can clean all this stuff up.",
